    title: "Pass.requires names tree-sitter-language-pack for 25 of 26 grammar-gated language passes that actually load dedicated tree-sitter-<lang> wheels; only humans read the field, so nothing catches it"  # c5bd
    status: todo_hard  # c5bd
    priority: 3  # c5bd
